-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-- R001 — REFERENCE DATA.  Runs in EVERY environment, production included.
--
-- This is data the application needs to FUNCTION, not data to demo with:
--   plans     — the Leash Plus subscription tier and its entitlements
--   products  — the store catalogue
--
-- Deliberately separate from db/devseed/, which must never reach production.
-- The original seeder created both in one pass; splitting them is what stops
-- demo accounts being created on a live server.
--
-- Safe to re-run: every statement is an idempotent upsert on the primary key.
-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

